# Project TITAN V1.2 — Module Expansion

**Architecture Lock — UI implementation planned**

## Philosophy

- **Optional modules** — use or not via 환경설정 ON/OFF
- **Never delete features** — OFF = hide sidebar · HOME · permissions only
- **Data retained** — re-ON restores full access to existing data
- **MES/ERP** — TITAN does NOT replace MES or ERP · modules survive MES build

## Module Management

Path: **관리자 → 환경설정 → 모듈 관리** (`/environment/modules`)

SSoT: `src/config/titanV12ModuleExpansion.js`
- `TITAN_MODULE_REGISTRY` — all modules · defaults · toggleable
- `ACCOUNTING_CLERK_MODULE` · `ACCOUNTING_MODULE` — function lists
- `createDefaultModuleFlags()` · `isModuleEnabled()` · `getEnabledMenuIds()`

## Toggleable Modules

경리관리 · 회계관리 · 문서관리 · 설비관리 · 통계관리 · NFC 시스템

## OFF Behavior

Hide: Sidebar menu · HOME widgets · permission keys  
Keep: DB/Session data · no delete

## New Business Modules

### 경리관리 (production-ready scope)

거래명세서 · 마감 · 미수금 · 매출 · 세금계산서 **발행현황** (홈택스 발행 — TITAN status only)

### 회계관리 (ERP support level)

전표 · 승인 · 계정과목 · 월별/원가/부가세 현황 — **ERP 대체 ❌**

## MES Aftermath

TITAN retains: quality · certificate · documents · accountingClerk · accounting · statistics  
MES provides: inbound · outbound · production · inventory

## Implementation Rules

1. Register new module in `TITAN_MODULE_REGISTRY` first
2. Wire menuIds · permissionKeys · homeWidgetIds
3. Use `isModuleEnabled()` before showing menu/widget/route
4. Do NOT delete data when module OFF
5. Do NOT implement module UI without PM approval — architecture config first

## Do Not

- Remove modules from codebase when OFF
- Force 경리/회계 ON for all factories
- Implement tax invoice issuance in TITAN (홈택스 only)
- Replace ERP with TITAN accounting module
